 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one objectively “best” title company, but **Independent Title of Fort Lauderdale** looks like a strong first choice based on the available review results: it has a **4.8/5 rating from 98 reviews**, including feedback praising communication and smooth residential closings.\n\nI’d also compare **Lawyers 1st Title** (4.8/5 from 55 reviews) and **CLOSED Title** (4.9/5 from 61 reviews). Ratings are only a starting point, so ask each for a written estimate of title and closing fees, who will handle your file, and how they’ll manage any condo, lien, or title issues. Florida’s Department of Financial Services recommends comparing costs and services and checking that the agency is licensed.\n\n**My practical pick:** Start with Independent Title, then compare its quote and responsiveness with one other company.",
